| Class | Severity | Trigger | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| `fall_detected` | 🔴 Critical | Torso tilt + body drop + aspect ratio + 3+ frames | Rule / LSTM / Hybrid |
| `aggression_detected` | 🟠 High | High wrist velocity + body energy + 2+ frames | Rule / LSTM / Hybrid |
| `prolonged_inactivity` | 🟠 High / 🔴 Critical | No motion for 60–120 sec | Rule / LSTM |
| `inactivity_warning` | 🟡 Medium | No motion for 30 sec | Rule |
| `unusual_movement` | 🔵 Low | AE reconstruction error only | Autoencoder |
| `normal_activity` | ✅ None | All checks clear | All |
| `no_person` | — | No pose detected | Pose extractor |

